# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# /f is the canonical form and the one FindingShareLink emits. This rule exists only for a
# hand-typed or rewritten trailing slash arriving in a browser; it is NOT what makes universal
# links work, because iOS matches the association against the URL as tapped, before any
# redirect. The association file lists both forms for the same reason.
/f/  /f  301

# Anything else on this host is a mistyped share link, not a website.
/  /f  302
